{"result":{"6534":{"term_id":"2038","string":"vertex power           #01130","note_id":"6534","note_type":"NA","note_lang":"en-EN","note_text":"<p><span class=\"\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.366px; top: 633.061px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00256);\" role=\"presentation\">(1) The unit for expressing vertex power is the <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.366px; top: 650.484px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00285);\" role=\"presentation\">reciprocal metre (m<\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 894.96px; top: 647.719px; font-size: 9.68645px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00607);\" role=\"presentation\">-1<\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 903.056px; top: 650.485px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00211);\" role=\"presentation\">). The name for this unit <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 667.996px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00222);\" role=\"presentation\">is the \u201cdioptre\u201d, for which the symbol is D.<\/span><br role=\"presentation\" \/><span class=\"\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 685.332px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00427);\" role=\"presentation\">(2) Conventionally the back vertex power, in <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 702.844px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00176);\" role=\"presentation\">dioptres, is specified as the \u201cpower\u201d of a <\/span><span class=\"\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 720.268px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00205);\" role=\"presentation\">spectacle lens, although the front vertex power <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 737.779px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00217);\" role=\"presentation\">is required for certain purposes (for example <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 755.203px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.0024);\" role=\"presentation\">in the measurement of some multifocal <\/span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: 775.369px; top: 772.627px; font-size: 15.1511px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(1.00192);\" role=\"presentation\">lenses)<\/span>.<\/p>","note_src":null},"6533":{"term_id":"2038","string":"vertex power           #01130","note_id":"6533","note_type":"NC","note_lang":"en-EN","note_text":"reference: R093:1999 3.7","note_src":null},"6535":{"term_id":"2038","string":"vertex power           #01130","note_id":"6535","note_type":"NC","note_lang":"en-EN","note_text":"<p>ID: 01130<\/p>","note_src":null},"6532":{"term_id":"2038","string":"vertex power           #01130","note_id":"6532","note_type":"DF","note_lang":"en-EN","note_text":"there are two vertex powers of a lens, described in 3.7.1 and 3.7.2","note_src":null}},"resume":{"status":"available","param":{"task":"fetchNotes","arg":2038},"web_service_version":"2.0","version":"TemaTres 3.6","cant_result":4}}